      "text": "Garbage Collection (GC)",
      "fontSize": 68.41432795448928,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Garbage Collection (GC)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mEhLD_hGltt09uSRX-5me",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2323.787801369249,
      "y": 140520.59304305934,
      "width": 1332.215576171875,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1rv",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1613988852,
      "version": 250,
      "versionNonce": 727413364,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770667400207,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Garbage Collection is a JVM process that re-claims the memory by \nremoving the unused objects. \n\n(Spark Application creates a lot of temporary objects for shuffling, caching,\nserialization etc.)",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Garbage Collection is a JVM process that re-claims the memory by \nremoving the unused objects. \n\n(Spark Application creates a lot of temporary objects for shuffling, caching,\nserialization etc.)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dAUWDc4VoxP9UltPCKhQO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2319.436971291124,
      "y": 140824.2247899538,
      "width": 1237.82373046875,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c1rw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 837064820,
      "version": 210,
      "versionNonce": 1806643444,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770667484794,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When the JVM runs Garbage Collection (GC), it stops the application\nthreads - STW Pause (Stop The World). That means, no computation \ntakes place during that time. ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When the JVM runs Garbage Collection (GC), it stops the application\nthreads - STW Pause (Stop The World). That means, no computation \ntakes place during that time. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
