      "text": "- Heavy Serialization\n\n- Row-By-Row Execution\n\n- Python Function called \n   millions of times",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Heavy Serialization\n\n- Row-By-Row Execution\n\n- Python Function called \n   millions of times",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
